    "Attack Attribute": "None",
    "Defense Attributes": "Fire 20, Water 20, Wind 53, Earth 20, Holy 20, Unholy 20",
    "Skills": "Raid Boss Lv. 1 Raid Boss reward chance is reduced based on the level difference. Boss is higher: +5 - 85%, +6 - 70%, +7 - 50%, +8 - 35%. Player is higher: +6 - 85%, +7 - 70%, +8 - 50%. If player is 9 or more levels higher, Raid Curse is applied. Raid Boss Lv. 1 The Captain of the Convict Mercenaries from Gracia, he is called the Lord of Slaughter. He is a powerful rival of the Bloody Lord Nurka. Given his superb diplomatic skills, he has established ties of friendship with many great nobles and high ranking officials. These nobles make frequent use of his troops, the Convicts, and in turn he uses the nobles to set up his plan to return to his homeland, Gracia. Humanoids Lv. 6 Takes 15% increased damage from attacks that are effective against Humanoids. Atk. Spd. +2.5% Accuracy +3 Evasion +2 P. Def. -5% Received Critical Damage +5% Resistance to Bleed -10% Resist Full Magic Attack Lv. 1",
